WEBVTT

00:11:28.434 --> 00:11:32.730
And with these data,
interest in the technology,

00:11:32.771 --> 00:11:35.232
funding for the technology

00:11:35.274 --> 00:11:38.193
and trust in the technology

00:11:38.235 --> 00:11:39.611
will continue to grow.

00:11:41.739 --> 00:11:43.574
Looking ahead,

00:11:43.574 --> 00:11:48.829
the packaging and delivery of mRNA
to the right organs and tissues

00:11:48.829 --> 00:11:51.957
will continue to be
one of the most significant challenges

00:11:51.999 --> 00:11:54.251
to implementing this technology.

00:11:54.293 --> 00:11:58.505
And so my colleagues and I are going
to be busy for a very long time.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.968
Ultimately, I'm here
with a message of hope.